From 1e533bdc5d8bba724ed83da9f76846679c99e2a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: warelik <warelik@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 21:24:41 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 04/12] Add shadows.project_panel and shadows.minimap settings

The sticky folder rows of the project panel and the minimap draw
shadows that read as visual noise in flat themes. These toggles turn
each of them off. Only the shadow is skipped; the sticky rows
themselves are unchanged. Both settings default to true, which keeps
the stock shadows.

ThemeSettings::from_settings deserializes shadows.project_panel and
shadows.minimap via shadows.as_ref().and_then(...).unwrap_or(true),
gracefully handling missing parent shadows objects and missing child fields.

Use descriptive settings names so the opt-in shadow behavior remains easy
to follow without changing its defaults.
